nagnou ko wayé sargal sa borom wala souniou moromou nitt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":705,"row":{"en":"And as AI continues to develop, it is likely to become even more powerful and capable.","wo":"Lu IA di gëna dem, amana dafay gëna xarañ dem ba gëna am doole ak kàttan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou IA di geuna dem, amana dafay geuna kharagn dem ba geuna am dolé ak kattane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":706,"row":{"en":"If you find a tick attached to your body, it's important to remove it as soon as possible.","wo":"Soo gisee kutt bu tafu ci sa yaram, li gën mooy nga dindi ko nimu gëna gaawe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo guissé kouth bou taf thi sa yaram li gueune moy nga dindi ko nimou geuna gaawé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":707,"row":{"en":"Trains can be romantic.","wo":"Saxaar yi mën nañu nekk lu romantik.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSakharr yi meun nagnou neuk lou romantik.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":708,"row":{"en":"These technologies are becoming true production solutions, especially for industries like dental and consumer products.","wo":"Xarala yii dafa baax lool ci yenn liggéey yu ñuy amal, lu ci melni dentist yi ak ñiy defar produit yi ñuy jëfandikoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKharala yii dafa bakh lool thi yenn liguey you gnuy amal, lou thi melni dentist yi ak gniiy defar produit yi gnuy dieufandiko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":709,"row":{"en":"Another example is a picture of a dog wearing a hat that is way too big for it.","wo":"Beneen bi mooy nataalu benn xaj bu sol mbaxana mu ku ëpp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeneune bi moy natallou bene khadj bou sol mbakhana mou kou eupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":710,"row":{"en":"* Add some chopped vegetables to the marinade, such as red onion, bell pepper, or zucchini.","wo":"* Daggal yenn lujum nga dolli ci marinade bi, lu ci melni soble, poivron, wala courgette.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagual yenn lujum nga dolli ci marinade bi lou ci melni soble poivron wala courgette.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":711,"row":{"en":"He didn't want to be responsible for spreading God's message.","wo":"Bëggul woon nekk kiy tasaare bataaxalu Boroom bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeugoul wone nek ki tassaré bataakhalou borom bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":712,"row":{"en":"They are all hoping to win the game.","wo":"Ñoom ñépp ay yaakaaru jël ndam li ci match bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnom gneup ay yakarou dieul ndam li thi match bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":713,"row":{"en":"Escape your daily routine and create a gorgeous wall display piece.","wo":"Dëddul sa jëffu bës bu nekk yii te defar ab nataal bu rafett booy wone.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeudoul sa dieuffou beuss bou nek yii té defar ab nataal bou rafét boy woné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":714,"row":{"en":"completely","wo":"ci anam bu mat","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nthi anam bou mate\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":715,"row":{"en":"Well, I'll buy one, the man said But you have to give me a rose in exchange.","wo":"Ku góor ki ni ko, dinaa jënd benn waaye fàww nga mayma benn rose.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor kii niko dina dieund bene wayé faw nga mayma bene rose.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":716,"row":{"en":"This is just one example of a relaxation technique that you can use to relieve stress and improve your overall well-being.","wo":"Lii benn misaalu pexem féexal sa yaram yu la mëna jëfandikoo ngir wàcce stress ba noppi féexal sa yaram wi yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nlii ben misalou pexem fekhal sa yaram youla meuna dieufandiko nguir wathie stress ba nopi fekhal sa yaram wi yep.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":717,"row":{"en":"The injured boy lost consciousness and fell to the pavement and his blood imbued the road dust.","wo":"Xale bi gaañu dafa xëm daanu ci trotoire bi deretam di tuuru jaxasoo ak pëndu tali bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé bi gagnou dafa heum danou thi trottoir bi dereteum di tourou diakhasso ak peunde tali bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":718,"row":{"en":"The pineapple is sweet and tart, the apple is crisp and juicy, the stone fruit is juicy and flavorful, and the pear is sweet and refreshing.","wo":"Ananas bi safna suukër xawa forox, pom bi wawna te barina ndox, fruit bu am saal bi barina ndox te neexna, poire bi safna suukër te dafay féexal xol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAnanas bi safna soukeur khawa forokh, pom bi wawna té barina ndokh, fruit bou ame saal bi barina ndokh té nékhna, poire bi safna soukeur té dafay fékhale khol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":719,"row":{"en":"Elaborate on how you continued to work independently while simultaneously keeping your team members in the loop.","wo":"Waxñu naka ningay weyyee di moom sa boppu ci liggey bi booba yangi and ak sa waa ekip.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWakh gnou naka ni ngay weuyé di mom sa bopeu thi liguey bi bobaa yangui and ak sa wa ekip.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":720,"row":{"en":"Bear in mind, constantly try to purchase silk plants, as they tend to appear like the genuine thing.","wo":"Bul fàtte, saa yu nekk deel jënd garabi soi ndax dañu nekk mbir yu yéeme lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBoul faté saa you nek déel dieund garabi soi ndakh daniou nek mbir you yémé loool.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":721,"row":{"en":"She was last seen wearing a black coat, jeans, and a white t-shirt.","wo":"Biñu koy mujjee gis mingi soloon màntoo bu ñuul, benn jean ak tiset bu weex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBignou koy moudié guiss moungui solone manteau bou nioul, bene jean ak t-shirt bou weukh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":722,"row":{"en":"The jobs generated would soon disappear in the grand scheme of things.","wo":"Yenn liggéey yuñ jote génne noonu lañu gaawe demaat ci mbir yu bari yooyu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYenn liguey yougn dioté guéné nonou lagnou gawé démate si mbir you bari yoyou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":723,"row":{"en":"Livingstone was a Scottish missionary and explorer who was instrumental in the abolition of the slave trade in Africa.","wo":"Livingstone ab misioneer ekose la woon bokkoon ci ñiy wër àdduna, liggéey na lu am solo ci dakkal njaayum jaam ci Afrique.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLivingstone ab missioner ecossé la wone bokone thi gniy weur addouna, liguey na lou am solo si dakal ndiaayoum diam si afrique.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":724,"row":{"en":"The German educational and industrial models are closely linked.","wo":"Royuwaayi njàng ak liggéey dañu lëkkaloo bu baax ci réewu Almaañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRoyouwayi ndjang ak liguey daniou leukaloo bou bakh si rewou almañ.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":725,"row":{"en":"Water also helps to lubricate joints and protect organs and tissues.","wo":"Ndax dafay rataxal fi yax yi di daje, ba noppi aar cër yi ak der yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdakh dafay ratahhal fi yakh yi di dadjé ba noppi aar thieur yi ak der yi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":726,"row":{"en":"As he was paying for his plants, he noticed a sign that said Free delivery for orders over $50 He smiled and added a few more plants to his cart.","wo":"Bi muy joxe xaalis ngir fay garab yi, mu gis liñu bind ci benn tablo Ku jënd lu ëpp $50 dañu la koy yóbbul doo fay Mu daal di muuñ ba noppi jëndaat yeneen garab.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi mouy diokhé khalis nguir fay garab yi mou guiss lignou bind si bene tablo: \"Ku dieund lou eup $50 dagnou la koy yoboul do fay.\" Mou daldi mougne ba noppi dieundate yenen garab.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":727,"row":{"en":"Ensuring resource availability for the development of the sector;","wo":"Fexe matal jumtukaay yiñ soxla ngir doxal sëktër bi;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFexe matal djumtoukay yign sokhla nguir dokhal secteur bi;\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":728,"row":{"en":"One of the most important factors in determining the outcome of a battle was the accuracy of the aircraft's bombing.","wo":"Li ci gënoon am solo ngir xam fu xeex bi di mujj mooy bomb yi ñuy sànni di dal fiñu ko bëggee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi si geunone ame solo nguir kham fou khekh bi di moudj moy bombe yi gnuy sanni di dale figgnou ko beugué.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":729,"row":{"en":"Dentist: (gives the patient a local anesthetic) Okay, this will numb the area so you won't feel anything.","wo":"Dàntist bi: (defal malaad anesthésie lokaal) Waaw kay lii dina tax doo yëg metit wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDentiste bi: (defal malaad anesthésie locale) waw kay li dina takh do yeug metite wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":730,"row":{"en":"No, you didn't! You just pulled right out in front of me!","wo":"Déedet, siñaalewoo! Danga jekki rek jël sa ndijoor nekk sama kanam!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDedet signaléwoo! Danga djekki rek dieul sa ndiodior neuk sama kanam!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":731,"row":{"en":"Tewodros II was a strong and ambitious ruler who sought to unite Ethiopia and to modernize the country.","wo":"Tewodros II amoon na doole, bëggoon lu baax, bëggoon Ethiopie nekk benn bopp te ànd ak jamono.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTewodros 2 amone na dolé, beugone lou bakh, beugone Ethiopie nekk ben bopp té and ak diamono.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":732,"row":{"en":"Vegetarian cuisine encompasses a wide variety of dishes and ingredients that are prepared without the use of meat, poultry, or fish.","wo":"Vegetarian yi am nañu ay xeeti toggu yu bari ay seeni saf-safal ak lujum, suñu leen di togg du am yàpp, du am ginaar wala jën.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nVegetarien yii am nagnou ay xeeti togu you bari ay seeni saf-safal ak lujum, souniou len di togue dou am yap, dou am guinar wala dieun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":733,"row":{"en":"But one thing is for sure: no matter where you are in Nigeria, you will find people who are warm, welcoming, and eager to share their culture with you.","wo":"Waaye lenn wóorna: fépp foo mëna nekk ci Nigeria, dinga daje ak nit ñu baax, ñu mën dalal nit, yàkkamti laa xamal seen cosaan ak aada.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé lenn worna: fépp foo meuna nekk thi Nigeria, dinga dadjé ak nitt gnou bakh, gnou meun dalal nitt, yakamti la khamal sen cosan ak aada.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":734,"row":{"en":"Interviewer: What are some of the challenges you've faced as an actor and a furniture designer?","wo":"Laajtekat bi: Yan xeeti jafé-jafe nga jankonteel ci sa liggéeyu aktris ak defar fotëy?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLaajtekat bi: Yan kheuti diafé-diafé nga diankonteul si sa ligueyou actrice ak defar photo yi?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":735,"row":{"en":"Our website and content are protected by international copyright laws and database rights.","wo":"Sunu ëmbiitu sitweb dafa am kaaraange loi àqu moomeel ak yelleefu base de done.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSounou umbitou sitweb dafa ame kaaraangé loi ak yellefou base de données bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":736,"row":{"en":"We must all stand up for freedom of the press.","wo":"Ñépp a wara xeex ngir sañ-sañu fësal xibaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGneup a wara khekh nguir sagn sagnou feusal khibaar rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":737,"row":{"en":"She will fight, deceive, negotiate, bargain, and surrender in order to protect the people she loves.","wo":"Aar nit ñi mu bëgg, jaral nako mu xeex, mu wor, mu diisoo, mu waxaale, ak mu dellu ginaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nArr nitt gni mou beugue diaral nako mou khekh mou wor mou diso mou wahalé ak mou dellou guinaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":738,"row":{"en":"I arrived at the festival early and was immediately overwhelmed by the sights and smells.","wo":"Bima yegsee si festival bi lima njëkka ëlëm mooy nimu bindoo ak yi fay xeeñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBima yégssé si festival bi lima ndieuka elem moy nimou bindoo ak yifi kheegn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":739,"row":{"en":"First, think about why you're doing the work.","wo":"Li ci njëkk mooy nga xalaat li tax ngay liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi si ndieuk moy nga khalat li takh ngay liguey.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":740,"row":{"en":"Whatever authority Muslim jurists may possess stems from their claim to speak on behalf of this religious command.","wo":"Bépp kiliftéef gu àttekati jullit yi mëna am mingi aju ci ni lépp luñu wax du seen waxi bopp, seen diine moo ko digle.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeupp kiliftééf gou àttekati djoulit yi meuna ame mingui adjou thi ni leup lougnou wakh dou seen wakhi bopp seen diiné mo ko diglé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":741,"row":{"en":"But eventually, I started to miss the slower pace of life in the village.","wo":"Ma dem ba tàmbalee namm dundu gu dal gi am ci village bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa dem ba tambalé name doundou gou dal gui ame thi village bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":742,"row":{"en":"We all run for the front door.","wo":"Nun ñépp nu daw jubal buntu kër ga.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNoun gneup niou daw dioubal bountou keur ga.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":743,"row":{"en":"Therapist: Can you tell me a little bit more about what's been going on?","wo":"Terapist bi: Ndax mën ngama gëna leeralal li xew seen diggante?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTerapist bi: Ndakh meun ngama geuna leeralal li heuw seen digganté?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":744,"row":{"en":"Just sit back and relax, and we'll take care of the rest.","wo":"Toogal nga ànd ak dal, li ci des noo koy def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nToogal nga andak dal li thi dess nio koy def\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":745,"row":{"en":"Absolutely, I quickly added. And we need to be aware of the dangers of distracted driving. Things like texting and talking on the phone can take our attention away from the road and lead to accidents.","wo":"Ma tontu ci saasi ni, Waawaw, boole danu wara xam loraange yi ci ñàkka bàyyi xel ci li ngay dawal. Lu ci melni dawal di bind mesaas wala wax telefon ndax loolu mën na yóbbu sunu xel feneen ba indi jéeya.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa tontou si sassi ni, wawaw, boolé daniou wara kham loraangé yi si niaka bayi khél si li ngay dawal. Lou si melni dawal di bind message wala wakh téléphone ndakh lolou meun na yobou souniou khél fénéne ba indi djéya.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":746,"row":{"en":"In the final seconds, Christian makes a basket to win the game for his team.","wo":"Ci second yu mujj, Christian dëggal boppam, seen ekip daal di jël ndam li.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi seconde you moudj, Christian deugeul boppam, sen ekip daldi dieul ndam li.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":747,"row":{"en":"The air is thick with the smell of sweat and sex.","wo":"Air bi dafa diisoon, di xeeñ ñaq ak awra.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAir bi dafa disson di khen gnakh ak awra.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":748,"row":{"en":"