ARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":754,"row":{"en":"The architecture firm, which has not been named, has denied the allegations.","wo":"Architeque bi defar kër gi, joxe wuñu turam, dafa weddi tuuma yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nArchiteque bi defar keur gui diokhé wugnu tourame dafa wedi touma yii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":755,"row":{"en":"One day, Amelia was walking home from work when she saw a man sitting on a bench.","wo":"Benn bis Amelia wàcci liggéey di ñibbi daal di gis kenn ku góor ku toog ci benn bang.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss amélia wathié ligueye di gnibbi daal di guiss kene kou goor kou togue thi benn bangue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":756,"row":{"en":"Vigilante justice is a term used to describe the act of taking the law into one's own hands, typically by meting out punishment to those who have been deemed to have committed crimes.","wo":"Doxalal sa bopp yoon mooy nit jog ni dafay doxalal boppam yoon, maanaam dem bay teg ay daan nit ñi mu jàpp ni dañu def ay ñaawtéef.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoxalal sa bopp yoon moy nitt djog ni dafay doxalal boppam yoon, manam dem bay tegg ay daane nitt gni mou diap ni daniou def ay niawtef.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":757,"row":{"en":"Kofi was outgoing and adventurous, while Sameer was more introverted and studious.","wo":"Kofi nit la ku bëgg génn ak saafonte waaye Sameer nit ku tëju la, bëgg jàng.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKofi nitt la kou beug guenn ak saafonté wayé Sameer nitt kou teudjou leu, beug diang.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":758,"row":{"en":"However, Mary refused to back down.","wo":"Waayen Mary nanguwul dellu ginaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayéne mary nangouwoul dellou guinaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":759,"row":{"en":"Once the clay is shaped, it is dried and fired in a kiln.","wo":"Su amee jëmm ci mu soxla, 